msgctxt "11975\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The former fourth chairman of the Tojo Clan. A legendary yakuza known "
"around Japan as the Dragon of Dojima due to the massive dragon tattoo on "
"his back. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12131\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The former fourth chairman of the Tojo Clan. A legendary yakuza known "
"around Japan as the Dragon of Dojima due to the massive dragon tattoo on "
"his back. Came to pay his respects for the departed after his feud with "
"Ryuji Goda and the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

