"around Japan as the Dragon of Dojima due to the massive dragon tattoo on "
"his back. Paid his respects for the departed and bid Kaoru Sayama farewell "
"after his feud with Ryuji Goda and the Omi Alliance. Currently in Kamurocho "
"with his adopted daughter Haruka to see everyone one last time before he "
"and Haruka leave for Okinawa."
