"his back. Moved to Okinawa and started Morning Glory Orphanage with his "
"adopted daughter Haruka after his feud with Ryuji Goda and the Omi "
"Alliance. Shocked to learn the man who shot both Daigo and Nakahara looked "
"exactly like the late Shintaro Kazama, he returned to Kamurocho, where "
"Kashiwagi was gunned down before his eyes."
msgstr ""

