"The former fourth chairman of the Tojo Clan. A legendary yakuza known "
"around Japan as the Dragon of Dojima due to the massive dragon tattoo on "
"his back. Moved to Okinawa and started Morning Glory Orphanage with his "
"adopted daughter Haruka after his feud with Ryuji Goda and the Omi "
"Alliance. Shocked to hear Tamiya speak of the CIA plot in Okinawa, he has "
"returned to the island to save Toma and Joji Kazama."
msgstr ""

