"between politicians and the yakuza in the Okinawa resort project."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113972\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Emoto Medical Clinic Owner"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114001\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The doctor in charge of Emoto Medical Clinic, the sole medical facility "
"within the Kamurocho sector. Provides free medical treatment to all in "
"need, regardless of financial situation, healthcare status, etc. His "
"hospital has been strapped for cash ever since the death of Shintaro Kazama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114292\tEXPLANATION"
