msgid ""
"An introverted boy living at Morning Glory Orphanage who tends to stay "
"inside reading books instead of playing outside with the other kids. "
"Aspires to be a doctor because both of his parents succumbed to deadly "
"illnesses and is studying hard in the hopes of getting a scholarship, since "
"Morning Glory may not have the funds to pay for tuition."
