msgstr ""

msgctxt "194287\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Okinawa-based Ryudo Family, he is an old-school yakuza "
"with a strong sense of loyalty, duty, and morality. He's also especially "
"good at building trust and familiarity with the local community. The "
"landlord of Morning Glory who is currently trying to evict Kiryu to use the "
"land for the Okinawa resort project. Has a daughter named Saki."
msgstr ""

