msgctxt "198903\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The hot-blooded, honorable captain of the Ryudo Family who loves Okinawa "
"more than anything, earning him the name the Fighting Viper. Is hostile "
"toward Kiryu due to his mainlander background, and is trying to force "
"Morning Glory off their land."
msgstr ""

