"The hot-blooded, honorable captain of the Ryudo Family who loves Okinawa "
"more than anything, earning him the name the Fighting Viper. Vows to join "
"Kiryu in Tokyo to catch the man who shot Nakahara and stole the deed to "
"Morning Glory. Refers to Kiryu as his aniki."
