msgctxt "255063\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Nakahara's Adopted Daughter, Loves Drawing"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "255108\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An orphaned girl that Nakahara is now taking care of as his own daughter. "
"She loves drawing, and is never seen without a sketchbook in her hand. "
"Nakahara took her in after a debt-collection house call in which he found "
"her alone standing next to her father, who had committed suicide right in "
"front of her. She is now mute due to shock."
msgstr ""

