msgctxt "262863\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Tamashiro Family Patriarch"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "262892\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Okinawa-based Tamashiro Family, and a flashy dresser "
"who is known for taking many lovers. He has been battling the Ryudo Family "
"for years over control of Downtown Ryukyu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "263086\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Okinawa-based Tamashiro Family, and a flashy dresser "
"who is known for taking many lovers. He has been battling the Ryudo Family "
"for years over control of Downtown Ryukyu. Buys up land for the resort "
"project at the request of Suzuki, the Minister of Land, Infrastructure, and "
"Transport. Tried to use Saki as a bargaining chip to get the deed to "
"Morning Glory from Nakahara, but his plan fails when Kiryu defeats him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "263525\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
