msgctxt "265555\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Tojo Clan Sixth Chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "265583\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The sixth chairman of the massive Tojo Clan yakuza syndicate, and patriarch "
"of the Dojima Family, to which Kiryu once belonged. The son of former "
"Dojima Family patriarch Sohei Dojima, he rose through the ranks of the Tojo "
"Clan after leading them during their war against the Omi Alliance. Tried to "
"control the goings-on in Okinawa at the behest of the Minster of Defense, "
"Tamiya, who feared the link between the resort project and the yakuza being "
"exposed. Shot by an unknown assailant at Tojo Clan Headquarters."
msgstr ""

