msgstr ""

msgctxt "277939\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Nishikiyama Family Captain"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "277968\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The captain of the Nishikiyama Family and most dangerous member of the Tojo "
"Clan, even from the perspective of Kanda, his boss. He tries to keep "
"himself composed but often loses his cool and resorts to violence. After "
"Kazuki refuses the Nishikiyama Family's attempted buyout of Stardust, "
"Hasebe tries to take over the club and use it as a base of operations from "
"which to attack the Kazama Family."
msgstr ""

