msgctxt "278982\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Hakuho Clan Chairman"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "279005\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The chairman of the Hakuho Clan and white-collar yakuza who amassed a great "
"fortune through the stock market and real estate. He rose quickly through "
"the Tojo Clan ranks by gaining Daigo's trust with his financial prowess and "
"clear, firm decision-making skills. Approved of Kashiwagi's plan to bring "
"Kiryu back to stabilize the Tojo Clan after Daigo was shot."
msgstr ""

