msgstr ""

msgctxt "281803\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The chairman of the Hakuho Clan. His whole life, he has attempted to win "
"people over with money due to his impoverished, orphanage-bound upbringing. "
"Joined the Tojo Clan in search of human connection and pledged loyalty to "
"Daigo, but lost his sense of purpose after Daigo was shot. Deepened his "
"ties to Black Monday in a bit for power and attempted to push the resort "
"deal through in order to see the military expansion bill passed. Enraged by "
"Kiryu's undying loyalty to Daigo."
msgstr ""

