msgstr ""

msgctxt "282597\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Hamazaki Family and a Tojo Clan lieutenant known most "
"commonly by his nickname, the Emperor of Hama. Controls Yokohama's "
"Chinatown from the shadows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "282769\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Hamazaki Family and a Tojo Clan lieutenant known most "
"commonly by his nickname, the Emperor of Hama. Controls Yokohama's "
"Chinatown from the shadows and is said to have ties to the Snake Flower "
"Triad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "282992\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Hamazaki Family and a Tojo Clan lieutenant known most "
"commonly by his nickname, the Emperor of Hama. Controls Yokohama's "
"Chinatown from the shadows. Contacted Minister Suzuki from the Ministry of "
"Land, Infrastructure, and Transport in an attempt to revitalize the stalled "
"resort project. Secretly promised an undergound casino on resort grounds to "
"the Snake Flower Triad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "283387\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The patriarch of the Hamazaki Family and a Tojo Clan lieutenant known most "
"commonly by his nickname, the Emperor of Hama. Controls Yokohama's "
"Chinatown from the shadows. Contacted Minister Suzuki from the Ministry of "
"Land, Infrastructure, and Transport in an attempt to revitalize the stalled "
"resort project. Secretly promised an undergound casino on resort grounds to "
"the Snake Flower Triad. However, he faces the wrath of the Snake Flower "
"Triad after Lau Ka Long is killed. His family falls into ruin and Hamazaki "
"himself disappears into the very shadows he was thought to control."
msgstr ""

