msgid ""
"Minister of Land, Infrastructure, and Transport who tryied to gain public "
"support for a new resort in Okinawa after being approached for the project "
"by Tamiya, the Minister of Defense, who wants to also push his military "
"expansion bill through. However, after learning that Tamiya's bill was a "
"hoax, he is attempting to proceed with the resort at any cost."
msgstr ""

