msgstr ""

msgctxt "290237\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The secretary of Tamiya, the Minister of Defense, who is trying to pass the "
"military expansion bill. Ordered by Tamiya to meet with Daigo and stop land "
"acquisition for the resort project when its yakuza ties were at risk of "
"being exposed. Sees the resort as a better option for his birthplace "
"Okinawa and refuses to give up on seeing it passed, even after halting its "
"progress."
