msgstr ""

msgctxt "292921\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Mysterious Man"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292938\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man believed to have shot Daigo at Tojo Clan Headquarters after first "
"shooting Nakahara and stealing the deed to Morning Glory. Bears great "
"resemblance to the late Shintaro Kazama, Kiryu's adopted father. Saves "
"Rikiya from certain death at the hands of the Snake Flower Triad and shoots "
"Lau Ka Long in the head."
msgstr ""

