msgid "Mysterious Man"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "293271\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A strange foreigner who attacked Kiryu as he was rushing to inform "
"Kashiwagi of the Nishikiyama Family's potential insubordination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "293405\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A strange foreigner who attacked Kiryu as he was rushing to inform "
"Kashiwagi of the Nishikiyama Family's potential insubordination. Was going "
"to shoot Kiryu, but ran off after sensing an approaching police car."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "293618\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Younger Brother of Shintaro Kazama"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "293655\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The younger brother of Kiryu's adopted father Shintaro Kazama and a former "
"detective at the National Police Agency, where he befriended Tamiya. "
"Dedicated his life to his job but was barred from the force after they "
"learned of his brother's yakuza ties. Left Japan disillusioned, traveled to "
"the U.S., and joined the CIA. Hoping to pass the military expansion bill to "
"draw out an international arms smuggling syndicate called Black Monday."
msgstr ""

