msgctxt "295352\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A CIA agent working for Joji Kazama who visits Daigo and urges him to help "
"in the CIA's plot to destroy Black Monday but is refused. Attacked Kiryu, "
"who was trying to put a stop to the resort deal linked to the military "
"expansion bill. Wants to see the project succeed at any cost."
msgstr ""

